    "detailed_description": "<strong>Go forward. Kill enemies. Collect loot. Get stronger. And again.</strong> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970220/extras/9f6ba8b645e4fbd4c604ace41bcf409d.poster.avif?t=1738237498\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970220/extras/9f6ba8b645e4fbd4c604ace41bcf409d.webm?t=1738237498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970220/extras/9f6ba8b645e4fbd4c604ace41bcf409d.mp4?t=1738237498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>An unusual mix of genres will allow you to focus solely on the choice of equipment and upgrades.</strong><br><br>The hero always goes forward, this is his way. You need to collect loot, choose weapons, upgrade the hero and find your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2>- Variety of weapons that perform well in different situations;<br>- You don't have to do anything besides picking up loot and choosing a character upgrade path;<br>- Large crowds of monsters;<br>- A bunch of items with different stats;<br>- Meta upgrades allows you to open new characters for a variety of gameplay.",
